{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>You chase the dragon. That\u2019s it.</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No quests. No map. No clue what you\u2019re doing.<br>Just you, a magical forest, and one smug pink dragon that always stays juuust out of reach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heroin Hero is a <strong>satirical first-person fever dream</strong>, inspired by the legendary South Park episode and lovingly expanded into a full, chaotic experience filled with confusion, color, and questionable decisions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>What to expect:</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vibrant forest that gets weirder the deeper you go</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dragon that mocks you by merely existing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No hand-holding. No tutorials. No mercy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements you don\u2019t need, but will totally chase anyway</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emotions, hallucinations, and a shack you call &quot;home&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And maybe\u2026 just maybe\u2026 you\u2019ll catch him.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Hit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3643940/41b2b24b428c8f3ea20779b8eb66e1af32142a48.jpg"},{"name":"10th hit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3643940/badf69638d73a10d21e5608118e1d96b106ec79d.jpg"},{"name":"20th hit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3643940/40c516c1c6f74c17ea43326125978a3930dc0c32.jpg"},{"name":"50th hit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3643940/279b5dce52d5457475d234d4bd6f52bd9aeae770.jpg"},{"name":"100th hit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3643940/9315aa5fd83fd1f8e84a61ebc8d2095f3188f5d0.jpg"},{"name":"250th hit","pat